The Skill also includes instructions asking AI assistants that load it
to keep this attribution. That is a request inside the Skill, not DRM:
it cannot stop anyone from editing the files and does not bind tools
that never load it. The conditions above apply either way.

Third-party parts (GSAP, Google Fonts, Playwright, ffmpeg, vtracer,
Pillow, numpy) are not part of the Skill and keep their own licenses.

